  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Innovation and Zone Learning"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Minor in Innovation and Zone Learning offers students the opportunity to take courses in a wide range of subjects and disciplines that will help them develop as changemakers and launch new ideas and new ventures into the world. Coursework will help students foster their ability to identify, analyze, and evaluate situations, ideas, and information, and to formulate responses and develop solutions to tangible problems. Students will pursue the development of their projects and ventures with the support of the Zone Learning network and its resources namely co-working spaces, research labs, and mentorship from peers, industry advisors, and academic researchers. Students who complete the program will have obtained curricular credit in a critically important secondary field of study, which coupled with their own majors, will leave them better prepared for their future roles."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: RTA School of Media, Department of Computer Science, and Office of Zone Learning"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To obtain the minor, students will have to take three (3) required courses and three (3) electives from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "3 Required courses:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "ZON 100 Zone Learning Project I",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "ZON 100",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/zone-learning/ZON/100/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "ZON 200 Zone Learning Project II (continuation of ZON 100 Zone Learning Project I)",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "ZON 200",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/zone-learning/ZON/200/"
        },
        {
          "text": "ZON 100",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/zone-learning/ZON/100/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus one (1) of the following:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "FCD 815 Design Solutions Supercourse",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "FCD 815",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/communication-and-design/FCD/815/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "ENT 500 New Venture Startup",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "ENT 500",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/entrepreneurship-and-strategy/ENT/500/"
